  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Assets:Fund
account Assets:Cash
P 2024-01-01 FUND 12 SEK
2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Fund  10 FUND {10 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -100 SEK

